			"widgets_values":[
				"Global Metadata\n- Genre: K-Pop EDM, Cyberpunk Dance-Pop, Future Bass\n- Subgenre: Electronic Dance, Club Pop, Synth-Metal elements\n- Tempo: 128 BPM (Driving four-on-the-floor dance beat, strong rhythmic groove for sharp choreography)\n- Emotional Progression: Mysterious and groovy -> Fierce and rhythmic -> Explosive dance drop -> Climactic and triumphant.\n- Production Profile: Punchy modern K-Pop dance production. Heavy sidechain compression, punchy EDM kicks, deep rolling synth bass, sharp percussive hits and snaps. Designed for sharp choreography with clear rhythmic accents and instrumental drops.\n\nVocal Details\n- Lead Configuration: 5-member female vocal group.\n- Timbre: Sassy and rhythmic in verses, bright and piercing in choruses, raw and emotional in the bridge.\n- Delivery: 100% MELODIC SINGING. STRICTLY NO RAP. Rhythmic, staccato melodic phrasing in verses (groovy and punchy but strictly sung on pitch), legato power belting in choruses. \n- Harmony & Effects: Dense 5-part harmonies in choruses, gang vocal chants during dance breaks. Wide stereo chorus on belting notes, subtle vocoder on backing ad-libs.\n\nArrangement Timeline\n- [Intro]: Punchy synth bass intro with rhythmic vocal chops and mechanical sound effects. Building tension.\n- [Verse 1]: 100% SUNG, NO RAP. Groovy dance beat, deep rolling bass, snapping fingers. Vocals are rhythmic, staccato, and highly melodic, leaving space for dance isolations.\n- [Pre-Chorus 1]: EDM riser build-up. Snare rolls double in speed, arpeggiated synths sweep upwards. Vocals climb with increasing power. A dramatic silence right before the chorus.\n- [Chorus 1]: Explosive Future Bass/EDM drop. Heavy dance beat, catchy synth hook, layered brass stabs. Huge 5-part vocal harmonies. Anthemic and highly memorable melody.\n- [Dance Break]: Instrumental focus. Heavy EDM beat, aggressive synth bass, gang vocal chants. Designed for sharp, synchronized choreography.\n- [Verse 2]: Similar groovy dance beat but with a half-time trap hi-hat pattern briefly, then back to four-on-the-floor. Sassy melodic delivery.\n- [Pre-Chorus 2]: Faster build-up. Intercutting vocal harmonies and rising synth effects.\n- [Chorus 2]: Same explosive drop as Chorus 1 but with richer vocal ad-libs and a more driving bassline.\n- [Bridge]: Half-time feel, stripped back and emotional. Sparse instrumentation: atmospheric piano and lush strings. Vocals switch to intimate singing, gradually building into a massive power belt with a huge drum fill.\n- [Final Chorus]: Key modulation (up half-step). Maximum dance energy. Crash cymbals, massive vocal harmonies, and soaring high-note ad-libs over the heavy beat.\n- [Outro]: Final heavy dance hit. Beat strips away abruptly. Lingering synth pad, final vocal chant, mechanical power-down sound effect.",
				"[Intro]\nSystem online.\nFive cores awake.\nWatch us move.\n\n[Verse 1]\n钛合金 吻过脊椎冰冷\n瞳孔里 银河无声下沉\n玫瑰若 只能在温室等\n我偏要 绽放成利刃\n\n光速中 裙摆掠过星云\n心跳声 引擎正在共鸣\n别用那 怜悯衡量我命\nI'm the blade you can't evade\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n引力坍塌 染红天际线\n五道轨迹 划破深渊镜面\n不回头 不祝愿\n把恐惧 压缩成 穿甲的执念\nLock on...\n\n[Chorus]\nWe bloom in iron, we bloom in fire\n钢铁里 开出最滚烫的姿态\n撕裂虚空 不为谁的王牌\n只为身后 亮着灯的星海\nRaise the blade, kiss the night\n五道光束 交织黎明的色彩\nWe don't fall, we detonate!\n\n[Dance Break]\nBoom! Boom!\nIgnite the sky!\nWatch us move!\n\n[Verse 2]\n异种的潮汐 漫过防线\n它们的语言 是无尽黑夜\n我用拳锋 回答这凛冽\n柔软 是引信点燃前 的决绝\n\n视网膜 铺开战术网格\n四枚棋子 我是最后角色\nSynchronize 五颗心重合\n这羁绊 比光速更独特\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n装甲之下 皮肤仍在烧\n伤疤是勋章 不是记号\n当深渊凝视 我们回以微笑\n扣下扳机 让它知道——\n\n[Chorus]\nWe bloom in iron, we bloom in fire\n用肋骨做牢笼 困住这阴霾\n不跪着求生 不哭着等待\n性感的定义 是星辉的偏爱\nRaise the blade, own the fight\n五台机甲 踏碎异星的残骸\nWe don't beg, we never fade!\n\n[Bridge]\nThey said we were porcelain...\nPretty things behind glass...\n可瓷器不会 在三千度重塑\n不会把眼泪 蒸馏成燃料\n\nWe are the storm... that chose its name!\n\n[Chorus]\nWe bloom in iron, we bloom in fire\n废墟的尽头 跳最后的痛快\n机甲会锈蚀 星图会更改\n今夜刻进光年 是我们的存在\nRaise the blade, kiss the night\n五道残影 烧成宇宙的最亮色彩\nWe don't end, we ignite the stage!\n\n[Outro]\n铁。骨。盛。放。\nWe ignite... the stage.",
